        "original_id": "e8c92280-2f3d-5828-886a-e746649c7e16",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Andrew Sprowle\n- Places: Portsmouth, Virginia; Elizabeth River; Hampton Roads\n- Organizations: Gosport Navy Yard; Norfolk Naval Shipyard\n- Roles: merchant; British naval agent; landowner\n\nFacts:\n- Andrew Sprowle lived circa 1714 to 1776.\n- Andrew Sprowle was a merchant, British naval agent, and landowner in Portsmouth, Virginia.\n- Andrew Sprowle is best known for establishing the Gosport Navy Yard.\n- The Gosport Navy Yard is currently known as Norfolk Naval Shipyard.\n- Norfolk Naval Shipyard is located on the Elizabeth River.\n- Norfolk Naval Shipyard is a short distance upriver from the mouth of the Elizabeth River at Hampton Roads.",
